, "short_description": "**LISTEN: BE AN EGG.**\n\n\nBE AN EGG **NOW!!**. \n\n**BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE**\n\n\n#these eggs are **CRAZY!!!** \ud83e\udd2a\ud83e\udd5a  \nyes, indeed. These eggs are quite insane.\n\nFull **MULTIPLAYER** shooter, runner, **BAZOOKA-er** with level builder.  \nEggscape has the most amazing BATTLEPASS of all games in VR!\n\nThe most absurdly fun cosmetics. **Weapons, power ups, the best rewards.** Become an EGGSTAR  \n\u2b50\ud83e\udd5a\n\nNew levels coming all the time \ud83c\udf1f\n\n**Free to play.**\n\n**ps: egg**"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.eggscape.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Eggscape Entertainment Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.eggscape.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24468781969414360"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300873_23870198839319351_707310657209983445_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-kcAMu8TaIYQ7kNvwGYO_V5&_nc_oc=AdmguMii7OdaYlNkJ3jijqWgPCl5frrikLv9giajr9H7T5vxhR7JH0mH-JK0SWxZ5D0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwX7CuB1JAlzv5VWJkleLFGkzuIywkUIqfjIBZwN_je2A&oe=69BD4686